                                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Input surface-load vectors [kN/m2]. One for each mesh-face. In case the number of faces is greater than the number of stress vectors the longest list principle applies: The last stress vector gets copied as often as necessary to have an equal number of mesh-faces and stresses.</item>
